SCOPE OF THE ABOVE

The MIT licence above covers everything in this repository, because everything
in it was made for it:

  - the four patch files and the coat colours they list
  - the showcase image and the mod icon
  - the packaging and the documentation

No file of purpleyam's is included. Their Colorful Coats - Cats and Dogs! is
the origin of the idea and of the name, and it is credited as such, but nothing
of it is reused here - the mod it patched no longer exists on its own, and the
coats purpleyam painted for those breeds live in a different port:

  https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2388932599

If purpleyam would rather this mod did not carry their mod's name, say so and
it is renamed or taken down. Immediately, and without discussion.

The animals are neither purpleyam's nor mine. They belong to Stray Dogs
(rescued) by Qux - itself the continuation of SpiderCamp's Dog Pack -, to
Let's Have a Cat! by akairo, to Vanilla Animals Expanded, and to RimWorld
itself. This mod ships no part of any of them and only patches them at load
time.

ATTRIBUTION.md records what was taken and what was made.
